@startuml 用户登录并播放歌曲-通信图
' ============================================================
' 场景：用户登录、浏览歌曲、播放歌曲的通信图
' 注重对象之间的链接和消息传递
' ============================================================

title myMusic 系统通信图 —— 用户登录并播放歌曲

' ----- 节点定义 -----

actor "用户\n(User)" as User

rectangle "React 前端" as Web {
    component "LoginPage" as LP
    component "HomePage" as HP
    component "useAuth\n(Hook)" as AuthHook
    component "Axios Client\n(拦截器)" as Axios
}

rectangle "FastAPI 后端" as Backend {
    component "/auth\n(认证模块)" as AuthMod
    component "AuthMiddleware\n(get_current_user)" as MW
    component "/songs\n(歌曲模块)" as SongMod
    component "security.py\n(JWT+bcrypt)" as SecUtils
}

database "MySQL" as DB {
    folder "users 表" as T_Users
    folder "songs 表" as T_Songs
    folder "play_history 表" as T_History
}

' ----- 链接关系 -----

User -- LP : 交互
User -- HP : 交互
LP -[hidden]-> HP

LP -right-> Axios : HTTP请求
HP -right-> Axios : HTTP请求

AuthHook -- HP : 路由守卫

Axios -- AuthMod : POST /auth/login\nPOST /auth/register\nGET /auth/me
Axios -- SongMod : GET /songs\nGET /songs/:id\nPOST /songs/:id/play
Axios .. MW : Bearer Token\n(请求拦截器注入)

MW -- SecUtils : decode_access_token()
AuthMod -- SecUtils : hash_password()\nverify_password()\ncreate_access_token()

AuthMod -- T_Users : 读写
MW -- T_Users : 查询
SongMod -- T_Songs : 读写
SongMod -- T_History : 写入

' ============================================================
' 场景1：登录流程
' ============================================================

note as N1
  <b>场景1：登录</b>
  ① 用户输入凭证 → LoginPage
  ② LoginPage 前端校验非空
  ③ Axios POST /auth/login
  ④ AuthMod 查 users 表验证身份
  ⑤ security.py bcrypt 验密 + JWT 签发
  ⑥ 返回 token → Axios 拦截器自动解析
  ⑦ LoginPage 存入 localStorage/sessionStorage
  ⑧ navigate("/") 跳转首页
end note

' ============================================================
' 场景2：路由守卫
' ============================================================

note as N2
  <b>场景2：路由守卫</b>
  ① 页面切换触发 useAuth Hook
  ② 读取 localStorage/sessionStorage 中的 token
  ③ 有 token → 允许渲染
  ④ 无 token 且非公开页面 → navigate("/login")
end note

' ============================================================
' 场景3：浏览歌曲列表
' ============================================================

note as N3
  <b>场景3：浏览歌曲列表</b>
  ① HomePage 挂载 → Axios GET /songs?page=1
  ② Axios 请求拦截器注入 Bearer token
  ③ SongMod 查询 songs 表 (current_status=1)
  ④ 返回分页列表 → HomePage 渲染
end note

' ============================================================
' 场景4：播放歌曲
' ============================================================

note as N4
  <b>场景4：播放歌曲</b>
  ① 用户点击播放 → Axios POST /songs/:id/play
  ② Axios 注入 Bearer token
  ③ AuthMiddleware 拦截 → security.py 解码 JWT
  ④ MW 查 users 表确认用户存在
  ⑤ 认证通过 → SongMod 执行业务逻辑
  ⑥ SongMod 更新 songs.play_count += 1
  ⑦ SongMod 写入 play_history 记录
  ⑧ 返回播放计数 → HomePage 更新 UI
end note

' ============================================================
' 场景5：私信
' ============================================================

note as N5
  <b>场景5：私信（通信路径示意）</b>
  ① 发送方 → Axios POST /message {receiver_id, content}
  ② AuthMiddleware 认证发送方身份
  ③ MessageMod 校验 receiver 存在 & 非自己
  ④ 写入 messages 表
  ⑤ 接收方 → Axios GET /message/received
  ⑥ 返回收件箱分页列表
end note

@enduml
